# Guide + X opens the on-screen keyboard; the controller types a key and B closes it.
tap lb 40
press guide
advance 100
tap west 60
release guide
advance 400
tap south 60
advance 100
press east
advance 700
release east
advance 200
---
pad LeftBumper down        @0
pad LeftBumper up          @40
shifts mode Guide layers - @40
overlay none + info 1      @140
shifts mode - layers -     @140
overlay keyboard           @140
sound keyboard Open pop    @140
sound keyboard Pick pop    @600
key KEY_Q down             @600
key KEY_Q up               @660
overlay none               @1460
sound keyboard Close pop   @1460
